{"version":1,"content":"\n<h5><strong>Podcast</strong></h5>\n<figure><p>\n</p></figure>\n<p></p>\n<h5><strong>上周焦點</strong></h5>\n<p><strong>蔡天鳳案｜控方指蔡欲賣樓　鄺球憂一無所有與兩兒動殺機</strong></p>\n<figure><figcaption>3 被告周五（2 日）下午由囚車押送離開高等法院。（攝：Curtis Lo）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"辯方大狀 Trevor Beel。（攝：張凱傑）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"682\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2026-10-02-06-1024x682.png\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption>其中一名辯方大狀 Trevor Beel。（攝：張凱傑）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"蔡天鳳 鄺港傑 鄺港智 鄺球\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/0269_01_content_01-copy-1024x683.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/><figcaption>左至右：鄺港傑、鄺港智、鄺球（資料相片）</figcaption></figure>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4e0DeDT\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day 6｜法官指一陪審員以健康理由要求退出　決定全體解散安排重選</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/%e8%94%a1%e5%a4%a9%e9%b3%b3%e6%a1%88day7-%e9%87%8d%e6%96%b0%e9%81%b4%e9%81%b8%e9%99%aa%e5%af%a9%e5%93%a1-%e6%9c%89%e4%ba%ba%e6%8c%87%e4%b8%88%e5%a4%ab%e7%82%ba%e5%9c%8b%e5%ae%89%e8%ad%a6-%e5%ae%98/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day 7｜重選9人陪審團　有人指丈夫為國安警　官：非充足理由豁免</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/3VYtrrO\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day 7｜控方：蔡因賣樓與鄺家關係變差　鄺球憂一無所有與兩兒謀殺蔡</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4dj7gCN\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Day 8｜控方：相信鄺港智下手　鄺球鄺港傑買錘仔湯煲　青紅蘿蔔烹屍掩味</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>據報涉煽動被捕　「爆炸頭」創辦人鄧浩榮及李盈姿被扣查後准保釋</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4dfMFPC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"爆炸頭 鄧浩榮\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"682\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/2026-10-01-01-1024x682.png\" width=\"1024\"/></a><figcaption>網媒「爆炸頭」創辦人鄧浩榮，周五（2 日）凌晨步出油麻地警署。</figcaption></figure>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4dfMFPC\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">據報涉煽動被捕　「爆炸頭」創辦人鄧浩榮及李盈姿被扣查後准保釋</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>護士認迷姦判囚　近7年後才釘牌　出獄任安老院護理總監　護管局經告發始知案底</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/3TFb7mW\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"丁書悅\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/nn-1024x538.png\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>11.18油麻地｜尼泊爾籍男暴動囚5年上訴失敗　判詞：冬季穿深灰短袖不言而喻</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4d8rr6c\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"11.18油麻地｜尼泊爾籍男暴動囚5年上訴失敗　判詞：冬季穿深灰短袖「不言而喻」\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/0275_04_link_01-copy-1024x538.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>5男與女童非法性交案　辯方結案質疑事主博關注</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/5%e7%94%b7%e8%88%87%e5%a5%b3%e7%ab%a5%e9%9d%9e%e6%b3%95%e6%80%a7%e4%ba%a4%e6%a1%88%e7%b5%90%e6%a1%88%e9%99%b3%e8%a9%9e-%e8%be%af%e6%96%b9%e8%b3%aa%e7%96%91%e4%ba%8b%e4%b8%bb%e6%90%8f%e9%97%9c%e6%b3%a8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"與14歲女童非法性交案\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/0263_06_link_01-copy-1024x538.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4dYRtZS\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">辯方指警稱「有帶套入少少唔太犯法」　被告：招認以迎合警方</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/5%e7%94%b7%e8%88%87%e5%a5%b3%e7%ab%a5%e9%9d%9e%e6%b3%95%e6%80%a7%e4%ba%a4%e6%a1%88-youtuber%e8%a2%ab%e5%91%8a%e7%a8%b1%e7%b4%84%e4%ba%8b%e4%b8%bb%e5%88%b0%e9%85%92%e5%ba%97-%e6%9c%89%e6%83%b3%e9%81%8e/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">YouTuber被告稱約事主到酒店　有想過性交但非唯一諗法</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/5%e7%94%b7%e8%88%87%e5%a5%b3%e7%ab%a5%e9%9d%9e%e6%b3%95%e6%80%a7%e4%ba%a4%e6%a1%88%e7%b5%90%e6%a1%88%e9%99%b3%e8%a9%9e-%e8%be%af%e6%96%b9%e8%b3%aa%e7%96%91%e4%ba%8b%e4%b8%bb%e6%90%8f%e9%97%9c%e6%b3%a8/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">辯方結案陳詞質疑事主博關注、將法庭當舞台</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4hBMD5P\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">首被告自行結案陳詞　冀陪審團勿因其教師身分有偏見</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>女子認誘騙兩女到詐騙園區　官質疑辯方稱沒恐嚇：揸刀揸槍着軍服唔夠驚嚇？</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4hvb9Wt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/0276_03_link_01-copy-1024x538.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>高級警司周毅剛警總非禮下屬囚5月3周　提定罪及刑罰上訴</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/3VDRSuw\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"高級警司周毅剛涉警總內三度非禮女下屬　兩女警供稱目睹被告手放事主腰及臂部\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/03/2026-03-18-01-1024x538.png\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>「海港Sir」陳凱港涉欺詐按揭貸款判囚6年半　向終院提上訴</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4yd9A5X\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"「海港Sir」陳凱港涉欺詐逾2600萬按揭貸款　被判囚6年半　向終院提上訴\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/0278_04_link_01-copy-1024x538.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>小股東向恒大物業索償　指招股書失實構成市場失當行為　證監會：不評論</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4xI90wt\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"恒大 中國恒大\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/2026-08-19-01-1-1024x538.png\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>宏福苑業主揀樓｜首日安排35戶　網站顯示34單位已售或已選　有人料補貼百萬</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4dbxp6o\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/Link_WFC_1-1024x538.png\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>\n<p></p>\n<p><strong>大律師涉超時盤問、無視當事人指示　被裁違紀釘牌3年提上訴</strong></p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://bit.ly/4hj8nVo\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"高院 高等法院\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"538\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thewitnesshk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/0001_HCCC_01-copy-1-1024x538.jpg\" width=\"1024\"/></a></figure>","scraped_at":"2026-10-03T17:58:37.830622+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":762,"images":12,"source":"The Witness","fallback":"rss-blocked"}}